    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McKenna Healy is delighted to present 8 Folkstown Park, Balbriggan to the market. A stunning, near new three-bedroom home presented in immaculate, walk-in condition throughout. Positioned within a modern A Rated development, this attractive property features a contemporary brick front elevation, cobblelock off-street driveway parking,and a convenient side entrance leading to the rear.\n\nDesigned for modern living, the ground floor accommodation opens from an entrance hallway into a spacious, light-filled living room at the front. Beyond, an inner hall leads to a guest WC and a dedicated utility room, culminating in an impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area ideal for family meals and entertaining. Upstairs, the bright landing leads to three well-proportioned rooms. The generous master bedroom suite features its own private en-suite bathroom. A second double bedroom sits to the rear alongside a third room and a main family bathroom.\n\nLocated within easy reach of Balbriggan town centre, 8 Folkston Park benefits from excellent transport links including the nearby train station, Dublin Bus services, and quick access to the M1 motorway. Balbriggan boasts numerous sports clubs (golf, Gaelic, rugby, cricket) and is home to the Irish Institute of Music and Song and the attractive Lark Theatre. The location is conveniently situated near the coastal village of Skerries and the beautiful Ardgillan Castle parklands. With only a minute's drive to the M1 motorway, the property offers very easy access to Drogheda, the City Centre, Dublin International Airport, and the Port Tunnel.\n\nThis is a superb opportunity to acquire a turnkey, A-Rated home in a prime location, sure to impress incoming purchasers. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> A1 BER Energy Rating</li><li> Sought after New Residential Development</li><li> Spacious Accommodation</li><li> Private Garden</li><li> Driveway with Private Car parking to the front</li><li> Air to Water Central Heating</li><li> Outside Lighting, Sockets & Water Tap</li><li> Wooden Flooring</li><li> Utility Room</ul>"
      },
